{"title": "Fleshmelter Cloak", "pageid": 10823, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak", "categories": ["Cloaks", "Uncommon items", "Sources of Acid damage", "Acid set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png/300px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Fleshmelter Cloak image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png/300px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Fleshmelter Cloak</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloak</a>. It deals acid damage to creatures that deal melee damage to the wearer.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Droplets of foul acid drip from the tails of this cloak, as if from the stinger of a demonic scorpion.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/38px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/50px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloaks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloaks</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 70 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a927e273-3385-4a11-8941-e952d0ddfd38</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a927e273-3385-4a11-8941-e952d0ddfd38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a927e273-3385-4a11-8941-e952d0ddfd38\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Acid_AcidMeleeCounter_Cloak+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Reprisal\" title=\"Caustic Reprisal\">Caustic Reprisal</a></dt><dd>Whenever a creature deals melee damage to the wearer, that creature takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> Damage.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing_Morgue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"House of Healing Morgue\">House of Healing Morgue</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;29&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-930</span>: In a gilded chest above the pit</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Caustic Reprisal:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Caustic Reprisal</b> only activates if the wearer takes damage. For example when damage is reduced to 0 by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\">Arcane Ward</a>, Caustic Reprisal does not activate.</li>\n<li>Acid damage from Caustic Reprisal does not activate the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion\" title=\"Ichorous Corrosion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ichorous Corrosion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion\" title=\"Ichorous Corrosion\">Ichorous Corrosion</a> passive on the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\">Ichorous Gloves</a>.</li>\n<li>Due to the way Baldur's Gate 3 handles its damage calculations, if the attacker lands a critical hit, \"Caustic Reprisal\" damage is doubled from 1d4 to 2d4.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fleshmelter_cloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Fleshmelter_cloak.png/509px-Fleshmelter_cloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Fleshmelter_cloak.png/764px-Fleshmelter_cloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Fleshmelter_cloak.png/1018px-Fleshmelter_cloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Fleshmelter_cloak.png/509px-Fleshmelter_cloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Fleshmelter_cloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201035\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1635/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33487/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6871/4194304 bytes\nHighest exp